> Using Optionals

# A test written under a heading

```catala
#[test]
#[testcase.testui]
#[testcase.test_description = ""]
#[testcase.test_title = "Declared under a heading"]
declaration scope Grant_heading:
  output calc scope Optionals.Grant

scope Grant_heading:
  definition calc.base equals $1000.00
  definition calc.bonus equals Absent
  assertion (calc.total = $1000.00)
```
